flowchart LR
  W["Host store commits<br/>the write"]:::ext --> D["Library diffs<br/>before / after"]:::lib
  D --> EV["Created · Activated · Deactivated<br/>Deleted · MembershipChanged · Updated<br/>(RFC 9967 names)"]:::lib
  EV --> PC["Post-commit listener<br/>at-most-once · errors logged<br/>never fails the SCIM response"]:::lib
  W -.->|"optional, same transaction"| OB[("Outbox rows")]:::opt
  OB -.-> RL["Relay · at-least-once<br/>dedupe on eventId"]:::opt
  PC --> CONS["Host actions<br/>sessions · API keys<br/>credentials · SSF / CAEP"]:::ext
  RL -.-> CONS

